#: sdlc/processes/publish-verification.bpmn:49
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Answered by the findings. `yes` (exit 0) ends verified; `no` (exit 1) ends failed, and the caller alerts the publication manager with the report after the deploy."
msgstr ""

#: sdlc/processes/publish-verification.bpmn:40
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Answered by the verifier set's exit code. `no` (exit 2 — nothing to verify, or a verifier could not run) ends as could-not-verify, which the caller treats as a failure: an unverified release is not a verified one. `yes` asks whether everything passed."
msgstr ""

